# Optional environment overrides for github-sec. No secret is needed: GitHub access goes through the `gh`
# CLI login and LLM review through the local `claude` CLI login. Never put tokens in this file.

# Root containing config/ (defaults to the repository root)
# GSR_ROOT=/path/to/github-security-researcher

# Where the SQLite database and caches are written (default: <root>/data)
# GSR_DATA_DIR=/path/to/data

# Where in-scope repositories are cloned (default: <root>/workspace)
# GSR_WORKSPACE=/path/to/workspace

# Tests only: skip the tests that need GitHub or the network
# GSR_OFFLINE=1
